		<p importance="default">Never place a rearward facing Child Restraint System on the front passenger seat, unless the air bag is deactivated.</p>
		<p importance="default">For semi-universal or vehicle specific CRS (ISOFIX or belted CRS), please see the vehicle list provided in the manual of CRS.</p>
		<p importance="default">If the vehicle headrest prevents proper installation of a CRS, the headrest of the seating position shall be readjusted or entirely removed.</p>
